Upgraded `@kitconcept/volto-light-theme` to 8.1.2, `@eeacms/volto-accordion-block` to 13.1.1, `@plone-collective/volto-image-editor` to 1.2.0, `@kitconcept/volto-social-blocks` to 1.1.0, and the other `@kitconcept` block add-ons to their latest releases, moving seven of them from alpha to final versions. The Event Calendar block stays available, but upstream no longer offers it as a Listing block variation. @ericof
